# A tab inside a line's text (as in a pasted table row) shows as space, so the words it separates do not run together.
# BUG: the tab is drawn with no width ("NamePhone"), and in edit mode the caret is drawn one column right of where typing goes.
file <<END
- Name	Phone	Email
END
see Phone
hide NamePhone
quit
saved <<END
- Name	Phone	Email
END
